Package: mod-apex
Version: 0.1.4
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: mod_apex maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Depends: apache2 (>= 2.4), libc6, libapr1
Description: Apache module embedding PHP (ZTS) runtime for mod_apex
 mod_apex is an Apache module that embeds a persistent PHP ZTS runtime.
 This package installs mod_apex.so and the Apache module loader file.
 It expects a compatible embedded PHP library at /usr/local/php-zts/lib/libphp.so.
